        {
          "text": "Abokhubaana baNafutali, tsinzibulo tsiabwe, mutsinzu tsiabwe khandi mubilibwa biabwe, obunji bwameera shinga olwa bwali, okhurula khubemiyika amakhumi kabili nende abashilaho, bosi abatuushile okhutsia mwihe, ",
