            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo nibo ababalwa, aba Musa naHaruni babala, nende abakhulundu baIsiraeli, abali abasaatsa ekhumi nababili; bali bario buli mulala khubeshilibwa shiabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
